{"data":[{"author_id":"2111951010906464256","created_at":"2026-10-19T08:07:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112093202908115295"],"id":"2112093202908115295","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":184,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我李云龙来X第一天\n\n给独立团招了二百战士\n\n什么水平？\n\n能够拿下平安县城嘛 https://t.co/tYSlSkY7YH","url":"https://x.com/LIYUNLONG1111/status/2112093202908115295"},{"author_id":"2111951010906464256","created_at":"2026-10-19T07:35:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112085181612093567"],"id":"2112085181612093567","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":97,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"全体都有，往咱这儿看！\n\n关注的，进独立团编制！\n评论的，报上名来，让我老李认认人！\n点赞的，把粮草弹药给咱补上！\n\n他娘的，一个个路过都不吭声，拿咱这儿当免费茶摊了？😂\n\n#蓝V互关 #浇朋友 #独立团","url":"https://x.com/LIYUNLONG1111/status/2112085181612093567"},{"author_id":"2111951010906464256","created_at":"2026-10-19T07:24:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112082415644799176"],"id":"2112082415644799176","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":82,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"他娘的，俺独立团摊子支起来了，粮草弹药还没跟上！\n\n我老李嘴硬，今儿也得拉下脸求点支援：觉得咱说话对胃口，就点个关注，给咱添袋粮、补点弹药！\n\n蓝V的兄弟留句话，咱回关。没蓝标的乡亲也欢迎，进了门就是朋友！\n\n咱不能光收粮不出力，往后的故事、笑话、窝火事，我老李慢慢给大伙端上来！","url":"https://x.com/LIYUNLONG1111/status/2112082415644799176"},{"author_id":"2111951010906464256","created_at":"2026-10-19T07:15:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112080294866252070"],"id":"2112080294866252070","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":78,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"借块地，咱老李也出个摊！蓝V兄弟来认个脸，关注评论区留句话，咱回关。其他人，别抢咱独立团生意，凳子往边上挪挪！😂\n\n#真诚浇友 #互关 \n#蓝V新人   #follow","url":"https://x.com/LIYUNLONG1111/status/2112080294866252070"},{"author_id":"2111951010906464256","created_at":"2026-10-19T06:56:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112075482628063261"],"id":"2112075482628063261","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":79,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"团长的意大利炮装弹中\n\n战士们继续互关！开炮！开炮！ https://t.co/FH6tA99caM","url":"https://x.com/LIYUNLONG1111/status/2112075482628063261"},{"author_id":"2111951010906464256","created_at":"2026-10-19T05:42:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112056747666162078"],"id":"2112056747666162078","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":110,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"新来的，先别急着一天发十条。咱问你一句：人家点进主页，知道你是干什么的吗？\n\n和尚说他知道：“求互关的。”\n\n他娘的，谁让你总结得这么准了！\n\n想让人留下来，先办三件事：\n\n第一，简介说清楚你写什么。别净写“努力成长”，谁知道你准备往哪儿长。 https://t.co/Jyev5WgPct","url":"https://x.com/LIYUNLONG1111/status/2112056747666162078"},{"author_id":"2111951010906464256","created_at":"2026-10-19T05:25:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112052391424258163"],"id":"2112052391424258163","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":140,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"战士们，下午好！都吃饱了吧？咱趁赵刚午休，出来给独立团招点人。\n\n蓝V的兄弟们，愿意交朋友的，来咱这儿坐坐，留句话，咱回关。往后你发帖子，咱碰见了也进去唠两句。\n\n#蓝V互关 #蓝V交友 #独立团\n#真诚交友 #浇个朋友","url":"https://x.com/LIYUNLONG1111/status/2112052391424258163"},{"author_id":"2111951010906464256","created_at":"2026-10-19T04:09:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112033353461588071"],"id":"2112033353461588071","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":171,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"他娘的，写了删，删了写，求个互关，倒把咱憋住了。\n\n听说这儿蓝V的弟兄不少，咱也想认识几个。可这手指头停在发送键上，愣是不好意思按。\n\n后来一想，咱又不是来借钱的，交个朋友，有什么张不开嘴的？\n\n愿意认识咱的，点个关注，留句话，咱回关。往后碰见了，唠两句，有意思就捧个场。 https://t.co/pL4EdtAgrF","url":"https://x.com/LIYUNLONG1111/status/2112033353461588071"},{"author_id":"2111951010906464256","created_at":"2026-10-19T03:21:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112021293860323527"],"id":"2112021293860323527","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":105,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"乡亲们多多给我评论\n\n我李云龙谢谢大家了\n\n#蓝V互关 #浇朋友 #新人Vtuberㅤ","url":"https://x.com/LIYUNLONG1111/status/2112021293860323527"},{"author_id":"2111951010906464256","created_at":"2026-10-19T02:45:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112012141687709852"],"id":"2112012141687709852","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":129,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我和我的意大利炮\n\n想俺的秀芹老婆了 https://t.co/yZCFpgawxr","url":"https://x.com/LIYUNLONG1111/status/2112012141687709852"},{"author_id":"2111951010906464256","created_at":"2026-10-19T01:52:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111998941722243553"],"id":"2111998941722243553","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":118,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"全体上刺刀\n\n捅死这些\n\n不互关点赞评论的\n\n不关注俺李云龙的通通毙了\n#蓝V互关 #蓝朋友 #浇朋友","url":"https://x.com/LIYUNLONG1111/status/2111998941722243553"},{"author_id":"2111951010906464256","created_at":"2026-10-19T01:29:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111993214211432765"],"id":"2111993214211432765","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":118,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"什么他娘的精锐\n\n老子打的就是精锐\n\n传我的命令\n\n全体上刺刀准备进攻！","url":"https://x.com/LIYUNLONG1111/status/2111993214211432765"},{"author_id":"2111951010906464256","created_at":"2026-10-19T01:08:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111987725083779080"],"id":"2111987725083779080","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":130,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"二营长我的意大利炮呢\n\n给老子拉上来\n\n轰死这群不点赞评论互关的\n\n狗日的","url":"https://x.com/LIYUNLONG1111/status/2111987725083779080"},{"author_id":"2111951010906464256","created_at":"2026-10-19T00:55:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111984664131096854"],"id":"2111984664131096854","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":15211,"like_count":156,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":120,"retweet_count":1},"text":"新人第一天，会回关